                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1944513125">1. AMBIENT Light current too high
2. Short circuit in wireharness of AMBIENT Light.
3. Short circuit in AMBIENT Light.
4. AMBIENT Light output of OHC defective.</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
