                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_1375737539">1. Check if REAR READING Light (Supply) are working 
2. Check wireharness of REAR READING Light (Supply)
3. If 1. and 2. are OK check OHC REAR READING Light (Supply) output (trigger light output)</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1282258365">Ignition ON</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_347478816">IfActive</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_494329520">If the status pin of the high-side driver reports an error when the output is activated.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1394278988">If the status pin of the high-side driver reports no error when the output is activated.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1602030561">1. Deactivation of REAR READING Light (Supply) for whole power cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1777454293">1. If first failure criteria occurs the aging counter is set to 40
